{"id":"3ccd03d5-4413-44c2-b132-95271a127a4a","expr":"(name == null && result == -1)","rationale":"If name is null, method returns -1, so result must be -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-12T19:04:24.550923Z"}
{"id":"155d2d69-ca73-4239-8048-3ac224334686","expr":"(name != null && result == x + name.length())","rationale":"If name is not null, result is sum of x and length of name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-12T19:04:24.550923Z"}
{"id":"d407029e-5119-4329-b4e7-3c586b9448e2","expr":"(result >= -1)","rationale":"Result is either -1 or sum of x and name length; sum cannot be less than -1 since name.length() >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-12T19:04:24.550923Z"}
{"id":"5613d0b5-a5d9-4a30-a19e-eb1dd9149a84","expr":"(name == null || result >= x)","rationale":"Because name.length() >= 0, result must be at least x if name is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-12T19:04:24.550923Z"}
